cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, assessments, or publications, please cite it as below."
title: "Pi Cyber"
abstract: >-
  Pi Cyber is a local-first security assessment harness for the Pi coding agent.
  It provides an offense-only engagement workflow, durable engagement state and
  evidence, a typed scanner toolset with a job runner, a local documentation
  index, and twelve specialist profiles for authorized security assessments.
